{
  "analysis": "I now have a clearer picture. The task is to create a medium-difficulty benchmark task for an AI coding assistant. The input file (inputs/description.txt) already exists with a description of an orbital sensor pod. I need to read the full SKILL.md to understand the complete template and then create the benchmark task that asks the AI to generate a Python/Trimesh script.",
