  "analysis": "The benchmark task has been successfully created. I have:\n\n1. `tasks/benchmark_medium_01.json` (1266 bytes) - The benchmark task definition with task ID, difficulty, title, user prompt, input file reference, expected output features, and evaluation criteria.\n\n2. `tasks/prompt_template.txt` (2455 bytes, 70 lines) - The complete prompt template that an AI coding assistant would receive, including:\n   - Terminal-style user request\n   - Component description from inputs/description.txt\n   - Concrete dimensions (core diameter 28mm, height 42mm, fins span 36mm, connector ring 10mm)\n   - Ambiguous aesthetic requirements (\"industrial look\", \"lightly armored\", \"layered panels\")\n   - Script template with Trimesh structure\n   - Requirements for STL export\n\n3. `inputs/description.txt` - The component specification file (pre-existing)\n\nThe task meets all requirements: medium difficulty, sci-fi spacecraft component, multiple primitive shapes, surface details, STL export, concrete dimensions, and ambiguous aesthetic requirements that force interpretation.",
  "plan": "Do a final verification of the complete workspace structure to confirm the benchmark task is fully created.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo '=== Benchmark Task Structure ===' && find . -type f -name '*.json' -o -name '*.txt' | head -20\\n",
